<title>USA: Third Financial acquisition price rises.</title>
<headline>Third Financial acquisition price rises.</headline>
<dateline>PIQUA, Ohio 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The terms of Security Banc Corp's acquisition of Third Financial Corp have been sweetened, to $33.41 per Third Financial share from $33.23 previously, Third Financial said on Friday.</p>
<p>The price increase mainly covers recovery of non-performing loans, said Third Financial Chief Financial Officer Scott Gabriel.</p>
<p>Third Financial said the deal, announced in April, should close late this month.</p>
</text>
